<title>HUNGARY: Hungary 3-mth, 6-mth BUBOR rates drop, 1-mth flat.</title>
<headline>Hungary 3-mth, 6-mth BUBOR rates drop, 1-mth flat.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hungary's Budapest Interbank Offered Rates (BUBOR) dropped for the three- and six-month maturities and remained unchanged for one month, the National Bank of Hungary said on Tuesday on its  BUBOR Reuters page.</p>
<p>The one-month rate was set at 20.80 percent, the three-month rate at 20.90 percent, down three basis points, while the six-month rate was fixed at 21.00 percent, down one basis point.</p>
<p>-- Budapest newsroom +36 1 327 4040</p>
